OL,3,AFestival honouring Dolly Parton set for
OL,4,ANashville and London
OL,5,
OL,6,FDolly Parton's estate has announced a
OL,7,Ffestival honouring the life and legacy
OL,8,Fof the late singer, set for London and
OL,9,FNashville.
OL,11,FThe "star-studded" two-day DollyFest
OL,12,Fwill happen across two consecutive
OL,13,Fweekends in both cities in 2027, her
OL,14,Festate said in a Monday press release,
OL,15,Fadding that the specific dates will be
OL,16,Fannounced later.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,165,160,200,105,0,100
